<h3><u>Acchi nahi ye baat</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Ashur ki shab hai sakina ka wo rona.&nbsp;<br />
Aur sayyade mazlum ke beti se yeh kehna.&nbsp;<br />
Are tu roya, me yeh dekh nahi, sakta sakina.<br />
(Achi nahi ye baat na roya karo bibi) x2</p>

<p>(Pehlu me kabhi maa ke bhi soya karo bibi) x2<br />
(Achi nahi ye baat na roya karo bibi) x2</p>

<p>1. Kya howe kisi shab ko jo ham ghar me na aaye<br />
Tum hamko na pao tumhe hum bhi nahi paye<br />
Tarpogi nahi dard se wada karo bibi<br />
(Pehlu me kabhi maa ke bhi soya karo bibi) x2<br />
(Achi nahi ye baat na roya karo bibi) x2</p>

<p>2. Are baitha karo kuch der charago ko buja kar<br />
Samja karo is khaak ko ay laadli bistar<br />
Baali kabhi yuhi nahi pehna karo bibi<br />
(Pehlu me kabhi maa ke bhi soya karo bibi) x2<br />
(Achi nahi ye baat na roya karo bibi) x2</p>

<p>3. Are kuch der to yeh farz karo ham na rah aagar<br />
Baaki na rahe haath koi rakhne ko sar par<br />
Mahaul yatimo ka bhi socha karo bibi<br />
(Pehlu me kabhi maa ke bhi soya karo bibi) x2<br />
(Achi nahi ye baat na roya karo bibi) x2</p>

<p>4. Aadat zara tanhayi me rehne ke bhi dalo<br />
Taswir tasawur mai asiri ki banalo<br />
Aazad parindo ko na dekha karo bibi<br />
(Pehlu me kabhi maa ke bhi soya karo bibi) x2<br />
(Achi nahi ye baat na roya karo bibi) x2</p>

<p>5. Are asghar ko na manoos karo pyaar se apne<br />
Akbar ki urusi ke na dekha karo sapne<br />
Sugra ki karib itna na baitha karo bibi<br />
(Pehlu me kabhi maa ke bhi soya karo bibi) x2<br />
(Achi nahi ye baat na roya karo bibi) x2</p>
</p>